Single:
|0 |TOP-N SORT           |
|1 |└─HASH GROUP BY      |
|2 |  └─EXPANSION        |
|3 |    └─TABLE FULL SCAN|vp_s(src_asym)|

repeat(2)[(NULL),(cast(...)=vp_s.c3)]
group([cast(...)=vp_s.c3], [GROUPING_ID])

Split:
|0 |TOP-N SORT                     |
|1 |└─HASH GROUP BY                |
|2 |  └─EXPANSION                  |
|3 |    └─SUBPLAN SCAN             |vp_s|
|4 |      └─SUBPLAN FILTER         |
|5 |        ├─TABLE FULL SCAN      |l|
|6 |        └─DISTRIBUTED TABLE GET|r|

repeat(2)[(NULL),(cast(...)=vp_s.c3)]
group([cast(...)=vp_s.c3], [GROUPING_ID])